### Sample requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client format).
### Replace @key with a key generated by `ledgerctl hash-key`.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@key = ldg_replace_me

### Create an asset account
POST {{base}}/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "bank", "name": "Operating bank", "type": "asset", "currency": "USD"}

### Create a customer wallet (liability) with an overdraft of 50.00
POST {{base}}/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "wallet:c-42", "name": "Wallet c-42", "type": "liability", "currency": "USD",
 "policy": {"kind": "overdraft", "limit": 5000}, "metadata": {"customer": "c-42"}}

### Multi-leg transaction (decimal amounts are parsed in the account currency)
POST {{base}}/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: topup-c42-0001

{"description": "Top-up with fee", "reference": "TOPUP-1",
 "postings": [
   {"account_id": "bank", "direction": "debit", "amount": "102.50"},
   {"account_id": "wallet:c-42", "direction": "credit", "amount": "100.00"},
   {"account_id": "fees", "direction": "credit", "amount": 250}
 ]}

### Pending (two-phase) transfer that expires after one hour
POST {{base}}/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "pending", "pending_ttl_secs": 3600,
 "postings": [
   {"account_id": "wallet:c-42", "direction": "debit", "amount": 2500},
   {"account_id": "bank", "direction": "credit", "amount": 2500}
 ]}

### Balance as of an event sequence
GET {{base}}/v1/accounts/bank/balance?as_of_sequence=3
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### History, newest first
GET {{base}}/v1/accounts/bank/history?order=desc&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Reconcile against a CSV statement
POST {{base}}/v1/reconciliations
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"account_id": "bank", "format": "csv", "date_tolerance_days": 2,
 "data": "date,amount,reference\n2026-03-02,1250.00,INV-1001\n"}

### Verify the audit hash chain (admin)
GET {{base}}/v1/audit/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
